/-!
# The conditional marked orthogonal action

The original two natural K-summands and the faithful L₂-plane action
construct the actual determinant module on P once the two source factors
are recognized as relative C-components. The coefficient field is the
independent field on P. The source application retains the literal join Y,
the quotient Y/P, both ordered factors, and original conjugation.

The literal V₂ and P/V₂ sections, the original Cartan, and the compatible
field consumer are supplied here. Orthogonal.Complete discharges the two
component premises. Source: Aschbacher--Smith, printed pp.774--775.
-/
